{
  "id": "1CO.16",
  "number": "16",
  "bookId": "1CO",
  "reference": "1 Cor. 16",
  "copyright": "The Holy Bible, New International Version® NIV® Copyright © 1973, 1978, 1984, 2011 by Biblica, Inc.® Used by Permission of Biblica, Inc.® All rights reserved worldwide.",
  "verseCount": 24,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "16",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "1CO 16"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "16",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "The Collection for the Lord's People",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 16:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Now about the collection for the Lord's people: Do what I told the Galatian churches to do.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.16.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.16.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 16:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "On the first day of every week, each one of you should set aside a sum of money in keeping with your income, saving it up, so that when I come no collections will have to be made.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.16.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.16.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 16:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Then, when I arrive, I will give letters of introduction to the men you approve and send them with your gift to Jerusalem.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.16.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.16.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 16:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "If it seems advisable for me to go also, they will accompany me.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.16.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.16.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Personal Requests",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 16:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "After I go through Macedonia, I will come to you—for I will be going through Macedonia.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.16.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.16.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 16:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Perhaps I will stay with you for a while, or even spend the winter, so that you can help me on my journey, wherever I go.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.16.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.16.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 16:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "For I do not want to see you now and make only a passing visit; I hope to spend some time with you, if the Lord permits.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.16.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.16.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 16:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "But I will stay on at Ephesus until Pentecost,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.16.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.16.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 16:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "because a great door for effective work has opened to me, and there are many who oppose me.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.16.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.16.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 16:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "When Timothy comes, see to it that he has nothing to fear while he is with you, for he is carrying on the work of the Lord, just as I am.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.16.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.16.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 16:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "No one, then, should treat him with contempt. Send him on his way in peace so that he may return to me. I am expecting him along with the brothers.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.16.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.16.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 16:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Now about our brother Apollos: I strongly urged him to go to you with the brothers. He was quite unwilling to go now, but he will go when he has the opportunity.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.16.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.16.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 16:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Be on your guard; stand firm in the faith; be courageous; be strong.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.16.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.16.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 16:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Do everything in love.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.16.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.16.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 16:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "You know that the household of Stephanas were the first converts in Achaia, and they have devoted themselves to the service of the Lord's people. I urge you, brothers and sisters,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.16.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.16.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 16:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "to submit to such people and to everyone who joins in the work and labors at it.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.16.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.16.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 16:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I was glad when Stephanas, Fortunatus and Achaicus arrived, because they have supplied what was lacking from you.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.16.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.16.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 16:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "For they refreshed my spirit and yours also. Such men deserve recognition.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.16.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.16.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "b"
      },
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Final Greetings",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 16:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The churches in the province of Asia send you greetings.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.16.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.16.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p",
        "vid": "1CO 16:19"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Aquila and Priscilla",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.16.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.16.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "greet you warmly in the Lord, and so does the church that meets at their house.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.16.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.16.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 16:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "All the brothers and sisters here send you greetings.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.16.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.16.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p",
        "vid": "1CO 16:20"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Greet one another with a holy kiss.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.16.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.16.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "b"
      },
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 16:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I, Paul, write this greeting in my own hand.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.16.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.16.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "b"
      },
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 16:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "If anyone does not love the Lord, let that person be cursed! Come, Lord",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.16.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.16.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "!",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.16.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.16.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "b"
      },
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 16:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The grace of the Lord Jesus be with you.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.16.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.16.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "b"
      },
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 16:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "My love to all of you in Christ Jesus. Amen.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.16.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.16.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
